WEBVTT

00:19:59.834 --> 00:20:02.555
The deputy jumped up
and ran over to this older Black man.

00:20:02.579 --> 00:20:05.183
He said, "Jimmy, what are you doing
in this courtroom?"

00:20:05.207 --> 00:20:07.976
And this older Black man stood up
and looked at that deputy

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.480
and he looked at me,

00:20:09.504 --> 00:20:13.726
and he said, "I came into this courtroom
to tell this young man,

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.585
'Keep your eyes on the prize, hold on.'"

00:20:17.199 --> 00:20:18.350
I've come to TED

00:20:18.374 --> 00:20:21.281
because I believe
that many of you understand

00:20:21.305 --> 00:20:23.330
that the moral arc
of the universe is long,

00:20:23.354 --> 00:20:25.194
but it bends toward justice;

00:20:25.218 --> 00:20:27.726
that we cannot be
full, evolved human beings

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.541
until we care about human rights
and basic dignity;